  stepId: Step_07_DHCPConfig
  instructionText: 'Configure the DHCP scope that will serve the lab clients.


    In
    the New Scope Wizard, enter the starting address of the pool, the subnet mask,
    and the router address handed out with each lease.


    Note the pool starts
    well clear of 192.168.10.10 - a scope must never overlap a static address.'
